					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							We are a small, friendly and supportive guild, with equal US and UK-based active members. Most members have a primary character in the guild at level 20-35, but there are several secondaries at lower levels to join in and help out with lower level members.<br />
<br />
We are usually around in UK evenings (9pm-2am GMT, or thereabouts) and on and off through the weekends, and have always tried to hold a Guild Event on a Sunday evening (afternoon US-time), whether this is a raid to help with a member's quest, a general bloodbath, or even a Drunk Monk run through Kithicor at night!<br />
<br />
If you would like to know m,ore, or would like to join, please hail any of our members online, visit our website at http://wyrdangles.moonfruit.com/, or email sally@tupia.net to arrange to meet up with some of us online. We look forward to meeting you!
